    "Name": "King Dragon DRG-23K",
    "Details": "The first refresh of the King Dragon, the DRG-23K replaces the two X-Pulse lasers of the -22K with three Snubnose PPC and slightly less heat sinks. The powerful 375 XL engine of the -22K was kept, leaving the a top speed of nearly 60 km/h untouched. Although the switch to the PPCs over lasers was an improvement on paper, many MechWarriors found it to be worse performing in actual battle which left the -23K with a slightly tainted reputation.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.3</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_kingdragon"
  },
